{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">晚上不少人到維園欣賞花燈，其中「國際中秋綵燈匯」的世界綵燈大街，因為人太多，晚上10時要截龍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Ir2gqEzlpC1790350224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">維園入夜後人山人海，大批市民及旅客中秋夜來欣賞花燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265oRy7AbjTF1790350263.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大熊貓人見人愛，化作花燈亦不例外。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">楊小朋友說：「(最喜歡)熊貓，因為熊貓燈飾很漂亮，他們的毛髮很清晰。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">各式各樣的燈籠璀璨奪目，除了傳統的喜慶紅燈籠，今年還有來自全球各地的特色綵燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NWhatvoSr21790350311.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.PARK-2300_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旅發局的「國際中秋綵燈匯」，連日吸引不少市民及旅客，其中「世界綵燈大街」因為人太多，晚上10時要截龍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PARK 2300..jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026EVzGwM0hJT1790350358.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PARK 2300..jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這個八米高的巨型榕樹綵燈是綵燈匯最大的燈組，以香港標誌性的大榕樹為靈感，茂盛的樹冠象徵團圓。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中秋正日天公造美，舉頭就可以望到明月。人月團圓的日子，最重要都是幸幸福福、齊齊整整。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T16:19:21.714737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}